          "id": 1248249227,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Yeah, the hope was to just use cmake_install on modern distributions, and to get rid of the version check.\n\nPossibly we could just redefine the cmake_install macro on SUSE here.\n\nLet me work on this, I can set up mock builds for the various distributions so we're not doing blind attempts at a fix.",
